Description: Provides programmatic access, local caching, spatial subsetting,
    and temporal aggregation for the Peruvian Interpolated data of SENAMHI's
    Climatological and hydrological Observations (PISCO). Specifically supports
    PISCOp v3.0 (1981-2025) gridded daily, monthly, and climatological rainfall
    datasets hosted on Figshare <doi:10.6084/m9.figshare.32411886>.
    Includes optimized workflows for basin-scale extraction, seasonal
    aggregations, and raster processing based on 'terra' and 'sf'.
